Third-party data notice

The benchmark examples in `examples/` are derived from public ClinicalTrials.gov
registry records retrieved through the ClinicalTrials.gov API v2, a service of
the U.S. National Library of Medicine (NLM). Trial records remain subject to
NLM's terms of use; this repository only redistributes a small number of public
records as evaluation examples, together with their NCT identifiers and source
URLs.
